# Exception: app/rideatlas-debug.keystore is intentionally committed - it's
# a sideload-only signing key (not for the Play Store), needed so every CI
# build is signed identically and installs cleanly as an update. See the
# comment next to its use in app/build.gradle.kts.
!app/rideatlas-debug.keystore
